 "items": [
  {
   "id": "a01",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "欢迎登上天枢号,探索者。我是 Armilla,你的舰载智能。星海已就绪,随时可以出发。",
   "file": "dry/a01.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 8411,
   "file_fx": "fx/a01.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 8385
  },
  {
   "id": "a02",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "请在航图上选定目标星域,或者告诉我你想去的星球。",
   "file": "dry/a02.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4989,
   "file_fx": "fx/a02.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4911
  },
  {
   "id": "a03",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "请系好安全带。天枢号即将离港。",
   "file": "dry/a03.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3030,
   "file_fx": "fx/a03.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3004
  },
  {
   "id": "a04",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "已切换至巡航模式。放慢脚步,看看我们身边的星辰。",
   "file": "dry/a04.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4911,
   "file_fx": "fx/a04.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4911
  },
  {
   "id": "a05",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "引擎加速模式已启动。抓稳了,我们要追上光的影子。",
   "file": "dry/a05.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4389,
   "file_fx": "fx/a05.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4362
  },
  {
   "id": "a06",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "点火倒计时:三,二,一。出发!",
   "file": "dry/a06.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4467,
   "file_fx": "fx/a06.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4467
  },
  {
   "id": "a07",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "正在减速,目标就在前方。",
   "file": "dry/a07.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 2168,
   "file_fx": "fx/a07.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 2142
  },
  {
   "id": "a08",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "已抵达,正在进入环绕轨道。欢迎来到新的世界。",
   "file": "dry/a08.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4258,
   "file_fx": "fx/a08.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4258
  },
  {
   "id": "a09",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "航行已由我接管。请移步侧舷窗,尽情观测吧。",
   "file": "dry/a09.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4650,
   "file_fx": "fx/a09.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4650
  },
  {
   "id": "a10",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "卫星式巡航已启动,我们将绕它飞行一周。",
   "file": "dry/a10.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3527,
   "file_fx": "fx/a10.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3553
  },
  {
   "id": "a11",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "控制权已交还给你,探索者。",
   "file": "dry/a11.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 2847,
   "file_fx": "fx/a11.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 2847
  },
  {
   "id": "a12",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "警告:前方温度过高。已自动保持安全距离。",
   "file": "dry/a12.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3918,
   "file_fx": "fx/a12.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3918
  },
  {
   "id": "a13",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "我们离这颗星球太近了,已为你悬停。",
   "file": "dry/a13.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3318,
   "file_fx": "fx/a13.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3318
  },
  {
   "id": "a14",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "引力弹弓航线已规划。借行星之力,再快一程。",
   "file": "dry/a14.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4624,
   "file_fx": "fx/a14.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4624
  },
  {
   "id": "a15",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "跃迁引擎充能完毕。星光即将拉成长线,请不要眨眼。",
   "file": "dry/a15.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4571,
   "file_fx": "fx/a15.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 4571
  },
  {
   "id": "a16",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "跃迁完成。我们已穿越星域边界。",
   "file": "dry/a16.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 2926,
   "file_fx": "fx/a16.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 2900
  },
  {
   "id": "a17",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "虫洞已稳定。前方,是另一片宇宙的入口。",
   "file": "dry/a17.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3866,
   "file_fx": "fx/a17.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3788
  },
  {
   "id": "a18",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "航行已取消,天枢号原地待命。",
   "file": "dry/a18.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 3187,
   "file_fx": "fx/a18.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3239
  },
  {
   "id": "a19",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "仪表已隐藏。好好记住这一幕吧。",
   "file": "dry/a19.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 2717,
   "file_fx": "fx/a19.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 2691
  },
  {
   "id": "a20",
   "group": "sentence",
   "text": "下次见,探索者。星星会等你回来。",
   "file": "dry/a20.mp3",
   "duration_ms": 4023,
   "file_fx": "fx/a20.mp3",
   "duration_fx_ms": 3997
  },
